{"id":533,"gn":"Pokémon Costaud","ft":["Même une armée de catcheurs se jetant sur son corps hyper musclé ne le ferait pas ciller.","Il entretient sa forme en transportant une poutre en acier et fait des concours de culturisme avec ses camarades.","Ce Pokémon hyper musclé manipule avec habileté les poutres métalliques et peut démanteler un immeuble en un clin d’œil.","Il participe à des concours de gonflette avec ses congénères et les Machopeur. Le perdant ne se montre plus en public pendant quelque temps.","Il manie la poutre métallique avec habileté. Il est doué pour démanteler une bâtisse, mais peu adroit lorsqu’il s’agit d’en construire une."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":1,"23":2,"24":0,"25":2,"26":0,"33":3,"34":4},"gr":2,"cr":90,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Humanoïde"],"gw":"medium-slow","gm":{"svmask":[0,86],"sv":[1,86],"swcrown":[0,58],"sw":[0,172,2,58],"xy":[2,94],"b2w2":[0,74],"bw":[0,39]},"f":{"533":{"n":"Ouvrifier","t":["fighting"],"s":[85,105,85,40,50,40],"h":1.2,"w":40,"a":[[62,0],[125,0],[89,1]],"av":["svmask","sv","swcrown","sw","xy","b2w2","bw"],"ls":[{"l":[[1,1],[43,1],[67,1],[88,1],[116,12],[339,16],[157,20],[21,24],[184,30],[223,36],[359,42],[444,48],[276,54],[264,60]],"m":[7,8,9,36,38,67,91,156,157,164,168,174,179,182,184,203,214,240,241,263,264,269,270,280,282,317,339,370,374,398,409,411,444,447,479,490,667,811,851],"e":[68,183,197,432,469]},{"l":[[1,1],[43,1],[67,1],[88,1],[116,12],[339,16],[157,20],[21,24],[184,30],[223,36],[359,42],[444,48],[276,54],[264,60]],"m":[5,7,8,9,25,67,91,116,156,157,164,173,179,182,184,203,213,214,240,241,263,269,270,276,279,280,317,339,370,371,374,398,409,411,444,447,490,496,514,526,667,693],"t":[811]},{"l":[[1,1],[43,1],[116,1],[117,1],[116,4],[117,8],[67,12],[88,16],[358,20],[498,24],[339,29],[157,33],[223,37],[184,41],[359,45],[444,49],[264,53],[276,57]],"m":[70,91,92,104,156,157,164,182,207,213,214,216,218,237,240,241,249,263,269,280,317,339,371,374,398,411,444,447,479,490,496,514,590,612]},{"l":[[1,1],[43,1],[116,1],[117,1],[1